  m_Name: 0_Chef
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC_Description
  lines:
  - "One of the CEO\u2019s personal chefs who has been working on the boat since the CEO\u2019s vacation trip started. He\u2019s an overweight guy with social anxiety, who is really shy and bad at talking. Ends up saying some of the creepiest weirdest stuff on accident, since he doesn\u2019t really have many conversations with people. Him and the CEO went to the same school, where the CEO bullied him endlessly. \r\n"
